@startuml
!include ../../_style.iuml
' Derived from: crates/openmeet-core/src/types.rs, ipc.rs (ActiveRequestView), providers.rs (LlmRequest, ChatMessage),
' settings.rs (AssistantSettings / LlmSettings defaults), crates/openmeet-engine/src/assist.rs
' (answer_question, answer_spec, start_primary, run_primary), requests.rs, runtime.rs (answerer_for,
' open_answer_for), crates/openmeet-intel/src/prompts/candidate_answer.rs (ID, VERSION, parse),
' src/overlay/state.ts (OverlayState, PrimaryRequest, onAnswerStarted, ANSWER_DELTA), src/lib/answer.ts (ParsedAnswer, parseAnswer).
title Object diagram: candidate-mode meeting with an answer streaming into the Primary slot

left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 45

package "openmeet-engine (Rust, in-process)" {
  object "state : EngineState" as es {
